        <mxCell id="boundary" value="A missing file or pending receiving handoff cannot complete collection progress. Partial capture keeps its recovery owner.&#10;Mapping or product failure preserves saved source files and independently permitted access. Recover only affected work.&#10;Source acknowledgement uses its confirmed contract milestone. Buyer acceptance and payment reports belong to lifecycle." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
